I should be able to:
- Manage my syllabus.
- Generate and follow a realistic study routine.
- Start a topic with one tap.
- Track study time.
- Maintain habits.
- Earn reasonable rewards.
- Monitor my progress.
- Import and organize textbooks and notes.
- Read PDFs in a proper reader.
- Remember where I stopped.
- Highlight important passages.
- Save bookmarks and personal notes.
- Download PDFs and read them without internet.
